## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的步驟將帶你從零開始，搭建一個現代、可擴展且易於維護的前端架構。  
我會以 **React + Vite** 為例（同理可套用到 Vue/Vue‑3 或 Svelte），並說明每一步的關鍵點、常見坑以及最佳實踐。

---

### 1️⃣ 規劃與設計

| 步驟 | 目的 | 工具 / 建議 |
|------|------|-------------|
| **需求梳理** | 明確功能（商品列表、購物車、結帳、會員中心等） | 需求文檔、User Story |
| **信息架構** | 設計頁面層級、導航結構 | Site Map、Flowchart |
| **線框圖 / 原型** | 視覺化 UI 布局 | Figma / Sketch / Adobe XD |
| **色彩 & 字體** | 建立品牌風格 | 色板工具、Google Fonts |
| **可用性測試** | 確保 UX 友好 | 用戶測試、A/B 測試 |

> **小技巧**：在原型中加入「可點擊」的互動元件，方便後續開發時直接對接 API。

---

### 2️⃣ 技術棧選擇

| 項目 | 推薦技術 | 為什麼 |
|------|----------|--------|
| **框架** | React + Vite | 快速啟動、模組化、社群活躍 |
| **狀態管理** | Redux Toolkit / Zustand | 統一全局狀態，易於測試 |
| **路由** | React Router | SPA 路由 |
| **樣式** | Tailwind CSS + CSS Modules | 原子化樣式、可維護 |
| **表單驗證** | React Hook Form + Yup | 高效、易於擴展 |
| **API 通訊** | Axios / Fetch | 標準化請求 |
| **測試** | Jest + React Testing Library | 單元/集成測試 |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions / GitLab CI | 自動化部署 |
| **部署** | Vercel / Netlify / Render | 靜態托管 + Serverless Functions |

> **備註**：如果你更熟悉 Vue 或 Svelte，替換相應的工具即可。

---

### 3️⃣ 初始化專案

```bash
# 1. 建立 Vite + React 專案
npm create vite@latest ecommerce-frontend -- --template react

cd ecommerce-frontend

# 2. 安裝依賴
npm install tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p

npm install @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
npm install react-router-dom
npm install axios
npm install react-hook-form yup @hookform/resolvers
npm install jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom
```

> **Tailwind 配置** (`tailwind.config.js`)

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./index.html",
    "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

> **PostCSS** (`postcss.config.js`) 已自動生成。

---

### 4️⃣ 建立核心結構

#### 4.1 `src/app/store.ts`（Redux Store）

```ts
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import cartReducer from '../features/cart/cartSlice';
import productReducer from '../features/product/productSlice';

export const store = configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
    products: productReducer,
  },
});

export type RootState = ReturnType<typeof store.getState>;
export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;
```

#### 4.2 `src/features/product/productSlice.ts`

```ts
import { createSlice, createAsyncThunk } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import axios from 'axios';

export const fetchProducts = createAsyncThunk(
  'products/fetch',
  async () => {
    const response = await axios.get('/api/products');
    return response.data;
  }
);

const productSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'products',
  initialState: { items: [], status: 'idle', error: null },
  reducers: {},
  extraReducers: (builder) => {
    builder
      .addCase(fetchProducts.pending, (state) => {
        state.status = 'loading';
      })
      .addCase(fetchProducts.fulfilled, (state, action) => {
        state.status = 'succeeded';
        state.items = action.payload;
      })
      .addCase(fetchProducts.rejected, (state, action) => {
        state.status = 'failed';
        state.error = action.error.message;
      });
  },
});

export default productSlice.reducer;
```

#### 4.3 `src/features/cart/cartSlice.ts`

```ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

interface CartItem {
  id: string;
  quantity: number;
}

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
}

const initialState: CartState = { items: [] };

const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<string>) {
      const existing = state.items.find((i) => i.id === action.payload);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += 1;
      } else {
        state.items.push({ id: action.payload, quantity: 1 });
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<string>) {
      state.items = state.items.filter((i) => i.id !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart(state) {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

#### 4.4 `src/main.tsx`

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client';
import './index.css';
import App from './App';
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import { store } from './app/store';
import { BrowserRouter } from 'react-router-dom';

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <Provider store={store}>
      <BrowserRouter>
        <App />
      </BrowserRouter>
    </Provider>
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

---

### 5️⃣ 路由設置

#### `src/App.tsx`

```tsx
import { Routes, Route, Link } from 'react-router-dom';
import ProductList from './features/product/ProductList';
import CartPage from './features/cart/CartPage';
import CheckoutPage from './features/checkout/CheckoutPage';
import HomePage from './pages/HomePage';

function App() {
  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-gray-100">
      <header className="bg-white shadow-md py-4 px-8 flex justify-between items-center">
        <Link to="/" className="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-600">MyShop</Link>
        <nav className="space-x-4">
          <Link to="/cart" className="text-gray-700 hover:text-indigo-600">Cart</Link>
          <Link to="/checkout" className="text-gray-700 hover:text-indigo-600">Checkout</Link>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main className="container mx-auto py-8">
        <Routes>
          <Route path="/" element={<HomePage />} />
          <Route path="/products" element={<ProductList />} />
          <Route path="/cart" element={<CartPage />} />
          <Route path="/checkout" element={<CheckoutPage />} />
        </Routes>
      </main>
    </div>
  );
}

export default App;
```

---

### 6️⃣ 主要功能實作

#### 6.1 商品列表（`ProductList.tsx`）

```tsx
import { useEffect } from 'react';
import { useAppDispatch, useAppSelector } from '../../hooks';
import { fetchProducts } from './productSlice';
import { addToCart } from '../cart/cartSlice';

export default function ProductList() {
  const dispatch = useAppDispatch();
  const { items, status, error } = useAppSelector((state) => state.products);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (status === 'idle') dispatch(fetchProducts());
  }, [dispatch, status]);

  if (status === 'loading') return <p>Loading...</p>;
  if (status === 'failed') return <p>Error: {error}</p>;

  return (
    <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {items.map((product) => (
        <div key={product.id} className="bg-white rounded shadow p-4">
          <img src={product.image} alt={product.title} className="w-full h-48 object-cover mb-4" />
          <h3 className="font-semibold">{product.title}</h3>
          <p className="text-indigo-600 font-bold mt-2">${product.price}</p>
          <button
            onClick={() => dispatch(addToCart(product.id))}
            className="mt-4 w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white py-2 rounded hover:bg-indigo-700"
          >
            Add to Cart
          </button>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  );
}
```

#### 6.2 購物車（`CartPage.tsx`）

```tsx
import { useAppSelector, useAppDispatch } from '../../hooks';
import { removeFromCart, clearCart } from './cartSlice';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function CartPage() {
  const dispatch = useAppDispatch();
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const cartItems = useAppSelector((state) => state.cart.items);
  const products = useAppSelector((state) => state.products.items);

  const total = cartItems.reduce((sum, item) => {
    const product = products.find((p) => p.id === item.id);
    return sum + (product?.price ?? 0) * item.quantity;
  }, 0);

  const handleCheckout = () => {
    navigate('/checkout');
  };

  return (
    <div>
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Shopping Cart</h2>
      {cartItems.length === 0 ? (
        <p>Your cart is empty.</p>
      ) : (
        <>
          <ul className="space-y-4">
            {cartItems.map((item) => {
              const product = products.find((p) => p.id === item.id);
              return (
                <li key={item.id} className="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span>{product?.title} x {item.quantity}</span>
                  <button
                    onClick={() => dispatch(removeFromCart(item.id))}
                    className="text-red-600 hover:underline"
                  >
                    Remove
                  </button>
                </li>
              );
            })}
          </ul>
          <div className="mt-6 flex justify-between items-center">
            <span className="font-semibold text-lg">Total: ${total.toFixed(2)}</span>
            <div>
              <button
                onClick={() => dispatch(clearCart())}
                className="mr-4 bg-gray-300 text-gray-800 py-2 px-4 rounded hover:bg-gray-400"
              >
                Clear Cart
              </button>
              <button
                onClick={handleCheckout}
                className="bg-indigo-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded hover:bg-indigo-700"
              >
                Proceed to Checkout
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

#### 6.3 結帳（`CheckoutPage.tsx`）

```tsx
import { useForm } from 'react-hook-form';
import { yupResolver } from '@hookform/resolvers/yup';
import * as yup from 'yup';
import axios from 'axios';

const schema = yup.object({
  name: yup.string().required(),
  email: yup.string().email().required(),
  address: yup.string().required(),
  paymentMethod: yup.string().oneOf(['credit_card', 'paypal']).required(),
}).required();

export default function CheckoutPage() {
  const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm({
    resolver: yupResolver(schema),
  });

  const onSubmit = async (data: any) => {
    try {
      await axios.post('/api/orders', data);
      alert('Order placed successfully!');
    } catch (err) {
      console.error(err);
      alert('Failed to place order.');
    }
  };

  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className="max-w-xl mx-auto bg-white p-6 rounded shadow">
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Checkout</h2>

      <label className="block mb-2">
        Name
        <input {...register('name')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" />
        {errors.name && <p className="text-red-600">{errors.name.message}</p>}
      </label>

      <label className="block mb-2">
        Email
        <input {...register('email')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" />
        {errors.email && <p className="text-red-600">{errors.email.message}</p>}
      </label>

      <label className="block mb-2">
        Address
        <textarea {...register('address')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" />
        {errors.address && <p className="text-red-600">{errors.address.message}</p>}
      </label>

      <label className="block mb-4">
        Payment Method
        <select {...register('paymentMethod')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded">
          <option value="">Select</option>
          <option value="credit_card">Credit Card</option>
          <option value="paypal">PayPal</option>
        </select>
        {errors.paymentMethod && <p className="text-red-600">{errors.paymentMethod.message}</p>}
      </label>

      <button type="submit" className="w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white py-2 rounded hover:bg-indigo-700">
        Place Order
      </button>
    </form>
  );
}
```

---

### 7️⃣ 測試

#### 7.1 單元測試範例（`productSlice.test.ts`）

```ts
import reducer, { fetchProducts } from './productSlice';
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import axios from 'axios';
import MockAdapter from 'axios-mock-adapter';

const mock = new MockAdapter(axios);

describe('productSlice', () => {
  it('should handle initial state', () => {
    expect(reducer(undefined, { type: 'unknown' })).toEqual({
      items: [],
      status: 'idle',
      error: null,
    });
  });

  it('should fetch products', async () => {
    const data = [{ id: '1', title: 'Test', price: 10 }];
    mock.onGet('/api/products').reply(200, data);

    const store = configureStore({ reducer: { products: reducer } });

    await store.dispatch(fetchProducts());

    const state = store.getState().products;
    expect(state.status).toBe('succeeded');
    expect(state.items).toEqual(data);
  });
});
```

> **提示**：使用 `jest.mock()` 或 `msw`（Mock Service Worker）可以更靈活地攔截 API 請求。

---

### 8️⃣ 部署

#### 8.1 Vercel

1. 在 GitHub 上推送專案。
2. 登錄 Vercel → Import Project → 選擇 GitHub repo。
3. 設定 Build & Output Settings：
   - Build Command: `npm run build`
   - Output Directory: `dist`
4. 點擊 Deploy。

#### 8.2 Netlify

1. `npm run build`
2. 在 Netlify Dashboard → New site from Git → 選擇 repo。
3. Build Command: `npm run build`，Publish directory: `dist`。

> **備註**：若需要後端 API，可使用 Vercel Serverless Functions 或 Netlify Functions；或將 API 部署到 AWS Lambda / Azure Functions / Cloudflare Workers。

---

### 9️⃣ 常見問題 & 解決方案

| 問題 | 解決方案 |
|------|----------|
| **API 請求失敗** | 檢查 CORS、環境變數、代理設定（`vite.config.ts`） |
| **樣式衝突** | 使用 Tailwind 的 `@apply` 或 CSS Modules；避免全局 CSS |
| **性能瓶頸** | 代碼分割（React.lazy + Suspense）、圖片懶加載、SSR（Next.js） |
| **SEO** | 若是 SPA，考慮使用 Next.js 或 Nuxt.js 進行 SSR；或使用 prerendering |
| **可訪問性** | 使用 `aria-*` 屬性、語義化 HTML、Keyboard navigation 測試 |

---

### 10️⃣ 下一步

1. **後端 API**：如果你還沒有後端，建議使用 Node.js + Express + MongoDB 或 Firebase。  
2. **支付整合**：Stripe、PayPal SDK。  
3. **用戶認證**：JWT + OAuth。  
4. **SEO & PWA**：Next.js + `next-pwa`。  
5. **監控**：Sentry、LogRocket。  

---

## 小結

- **規劃**：先把 UI/UX 設計好，避免後期重構。  
- **技術棧**：React + Vite + Tailwind + Redux Toolkit 是最常見且高效的組合。  
- **結構**：把功能拆分成 feature folders，保持單一責任。  
- **測試**：寫單元測試和集成測試，確保穩定。  
- **部署**：Vercel / Netlify 讓部署變得輕鬆。  

祝你開發順利，打造出既美觀又高效的電子商務前端！如果你有任何具體問題（例如 API 整合、支付流程、SEO 等），隨時告訴我，我可以提供更詳細的代碼示例或解決方案。
